        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Lt. Robin Crusoe, U.S.N.; The Apple Dumpling Gang\n- Companies: Walt Disney; Walt Disney Productions\n- People: Dick Van Dyke; Bill Bixby\n- Topics: comedy films; American comedy-western films; castaways; California Gold Rush\n\nFacts:\n- Lt. Robin Crusoe, U.S.N. is a 1966 comedy film that was released and scripted by Walt Disney.\n- Lt. Robin Crusoe, U.S.N. stars Dick Van Dyke as a U.S. Navy pilot who becomes a castaway on a tropical island.\n- The Apple Dumpling Gang is a 1975 American comedy-western film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- The Apple Dumpling Gang follows slick gambler Russell Donovan, played by Bill Bixby, who is duped into caring for a group of orphans who later strike gold during the California Gold Rush.",
